text:
@hippiedaytrader you never got the face of the man who brought the ballots in on camera.

This is the most frustrating video I’ve ever seen. You point the camera at this guys legs and back, then at the box of ballots. Then you mistakenly identify the man who was standing behind the scanner the whole time as “THIS GUY”. Then you record a police officer or guard taking the ballots away. 

BUT YOU NEVER GOT THE BALLOT-DELIVERER’S FACE ON CAMERA!

